  displayName: Summon Undead
  description: 'This spell summons a group of Undead monsters around the spellcaster
    to protect them. Their number and type are determined by rolling 1 red die.

    1
    or 2 = 4 skeletons.

    3 or 4 = 3 skeletons, 2 zombies.

    5 or 6 = 2 zombies,
    2 mummies.'
